<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Toko Intan - Reset Password</title>
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        background-color: #ffffff;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }
      .container {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 20px auto;
        background-color: #ffffff;
        border: 2px solid #059669;
        border-radius: 12px;
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
      }
      .header {
        text-align: center;
        padding: 25px;
        background-color: #f8fafc;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      }
      .header-text {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 24px;
        font-weight: 800;
        color: #059669;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
      }
      .content {
        padding: 40px 30px;
        color: #475569;
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }
      .content h2 {
        font-size: 22px;
        color: #1e293b;
        margin-bottom: 15px;
      }
      .action-box {
        text-align: center;
        margin: 35px 0;
      }
      .btn-reset {
        background-color: #059669;
        color: #ffffff !important;
        padding: 16px 32px;
        text-decoration: none;
        border-radius: 10px;
        font-weight: bold;
        font-size: 16px;
        display: inline-block;
      }
      .expiry-info {
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #94a3b8;
        margin-top: 15px;
        display: block;
      }
      .security-note {
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #92400e;
        margin-top: 30px;
        padding: 15px;
        background-color: #fffbeb;
        border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b;
        border-radius: 4px;
      }
      .footer {
        background: #f8fafc;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #64748b;
        padding: 20px;
        border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <table class="container" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center">
      <tr>
        <td class="header">
          <p class="header-text">TOKO INTAN</p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="content">
          <h2>Atur Ulang Kata Sandi</h2>
          <p>Halo <strong><%= username %></strong>,</p>
          <p>Kami menerima permintaan untuk mereset kata sandi akun Admin Anda. Jangan khawatir, kami siap membantu Anda masuk kembali.</p>

          <div class="action-box">
            <a href="<%= resetLink %>" class="btn-reset">RESET PASSWORD SEKARANG</a>
            <span class="expiry-info">Tautan ini berlaku selama 60 menit.</span>
          </div>

          <div class="security-note"><strong>Keamanan:</strong> Jika Anda tidak merasa melakukan permintaan ini, abaikan saja email ini. Kata sandi Anda akan tetap aman.</div>

          <p style="margin-top: 30px">Terima kasih,<br /><strong>Tim IT Toko Intan</strong></p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="footer">
          <p>&copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Toko Intan POS. All rights reserved.</p>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
